<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">hemorrhagic-wave</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Hemorrhagic Wave</ansi> spell sends a rippling burst of vital force
outward, rupturing blood vessels in every foe it touches. Less
concentrated than its burst variant, the wave trades raw impact for
wider reach and more sustainable conviction cost.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast hemorrhagic-wave</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Harm Area
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Vital
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> 20
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> 80
  <ansi fg="yellow">Defense:     </ansi> Physical — constitution and armor blunt the wave
  <ansi fg="yellow">Effect:      </ansi> Moderate damage to all enemies in the room

